<%= render layout: "pages/page", locals: { title: "Refund and Cancellation Policy", subtitle: "Last updated: 22 October 2026" } do %>
  <p>This policy explains refunds and cancellations for CoffeeBean AI plans. CoffeeBean AI is owned and operated by <strong><%= COMPANY[:legal_name] %></strong>.</p>

  <h2>All sales are final</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Every CoffeeBean AI plan (<%= Plan::PLANS.map { |p| "#{p.name}: ₹#{number_with_delimiter(p.price)}" }.join(", ") %>) is a digital service. You get access straight after the payment is confirmed.</li>
    <li>Because of this, <strong>all sales are final</strong>. Once a plan is bought, we do not give refunds, including for unused time.</li>
    <li>Please read the <%= link_to "Pricing", pricing_path %> page and the course descriptions before you buy, so you know what the plans include.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>When we do give a refund</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Charged twice</strong> for the same order, or charged but your access did not start: we refund the extra or failed payment in full.</li>
    <li><strong>Money left your account but the order failed:</strong> this is usually reversed automatically by the bank or PayU within 5 to 7 working days. If it is not, write to us and we will help.</li>
    <li><strong>We close your account without a good reason:</strong> we refund the unused part of your plan.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>Approved refunds go back to the same payment method (UPI, card, net banking or wallet). They usually reach you within 5 to 7 working days after we approve them. The exact time depends on your bank.</p>

  <h2>Cancellation</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>The plan does not renew automatically, so there is nothing to cancel. When your plan ends, you will not be charged again.</li>
    <li>You can stop using CoffeeBean AI at any time. Stopping early does not give a refund for the remaining time.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>How to ask for help</h2>
  <p>Write to <a href="mailto:<%= COMPANY[:email] %>"><%= COMPANY[:email] %></a> from your account email address. Include your order number (you can find it on the <%= link_to "Pricing", pricing_path %> page under "Your payments"), the date and the amount. We reply within two working days. Support hours: <%= COMPANY[:hours] %>.</p>
<% end %>
